      ],
      "text": "School:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " be alert for ADHD and learning dx; for CSHCN, review the IEP, Section 504 Plan, or any special accommodations."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
