    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "A 5- or 6-yo (Bright Futures):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " balances on 1 foot and skips; ties a knot, mature pencil grasp, draws a person w ± 6 body parts, prints some letters and numbers, copies squares and triangles; good articulation, tells a simple story in full sentences, appropriate tenses and pronouns, names ± 4 colors; follows simple directions, listens and attends, dresses and undresses w minimal help."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
